SOAPBOX: A simple and genuine CQWW RTTY effort: two operators, one station and only vertical antennas.
SOAPBOX: We knew we were sharing the bands with much bigger stations and impressive antenna systems, but we just focused on doing the best with what we had. Good teamwork, lots of operating and plenty of fun.Maybe not the biggest station on the band, but definitely a real contest effort.
SOAPBOX: 73 de IO5F – Vertical Team
SOAPBOX: It’s not the result, it’s how you do it!
